<%
// Eta template: copilot/instructions.eta — Phase 13 WP 13.2
// Receives: it = WorkspaceContextEnvelope
// Output:   text/markdown — .github/copilot-instructions.md content
//           with safe-write delimiters
function renderStory(s) {
  const badge = s.is_stack_default ? " [STACK DEFAULT]" : "";
  const status = s.status || "unknown";
  return "- **" + s.title + "** — `" + s.id + "` — status: `" + status + "`" + badge;
}
const storiesList = (!it.stories || it.stories.length === 0)
  ? "_No active stories._"
  : it.stories.map(renderStory).join("\n");
%># .github/copilot-instructions.md — AISHA (dynamic, <%= it.generated_at %>)

<!-- AISHA-MANAGED-START -->
This repository implements the AISHA platform. When suggesting code, follow these absolute rules:

1. Hook-Only Data Access (API calls only via custom hooks).
2. No `any` types (TypeScript strict or unknown + guard).
3. Zod validation for all external data.
4. i18n for all UI text (no hardcoded strings).
5. `safeError()` instead of `console.log` / `console.error`.
6. No emoji in UI — lucide-react icons only.
7. RPC-Only — use `rpcUser()` / `rpcService()`, never PostgREST table-builder queries.

## Current workspace state (dynamic)

Active stories (<%= (it.stories || []).length %>):
<%~ storiesList %>

Other counters:
